Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:06.47,TitleGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)\blur2.5}Sweater Weather\N{\fs88\fsp6\b0}The Neighbourhood (Slowed + Reverb)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:16.18,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And all I am is a man\NI want the world in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:25.20,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}I hate the beach, but I stand\NIn California, with my toes in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:29.83,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Use the sleeves of my sweater\NLet's have an adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:34.22,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Head in the clouds\NBut my gravity's centered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:43.24,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Touch my neck, and I'll touch yours\nYou in those little high-waisted shorts, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:49.25,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She knows what I think about\NAnd what I think about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:53.99,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}One love, two mouths\NOne love, one house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:58.38,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}No shirt, no blouse\NJust us, you find out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:01:05.32,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Nothing that I wouldn't\NWanna tell you about, no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:10.06,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}'Cause it's too cold\NFor you here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:20.35,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}So let me hold\NBoth your hands in the holes of my sweater
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:24.97,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And if I may just take your breath away\NI don't mind if there's not much to say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:29.60,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Sometimes the silence guides our minds\NSo move to a place so far away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:34.22,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}The goosebumps start to raise\nThe minute that my left hand meets your waist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:36.18,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And then I watch your face
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:39.19,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Put my finger on your tongue\N'Cause you love to taste, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:43.12,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}These hearts adore\NEveryone the other beats hardest for
